abstract: >-
  Scripts that rebuild, from public data, every number, figure and volume of the report
  "Coada de la Registrul Comerțului" (Romanian Trade Registry queue, November 2026):
  BERC decision archive, a myportal sample, Ministry of Justice notes and Ministry of Finance
  balance sheets. Every published number is traceable through a claims registry; selected
  statements are machine-checked in Lean 4. Produced with AI assistance (Claude Opus 5.5,
  Gemini 4 Neon) under the author's guidance and verification.
